        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/132d231c7e1a5fb664c1217532418dba.avif?t=1788945491\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras_big/132d231c7e1a5fb664c1217532418dba.webp?t=1788945491 width=1560 height=502 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become Slimey, a tiny blob with an unstoppable bounce, and make your way through colorful worlds full of platforming challenges, hidden paths, dangerous hazards, and plenty of secrets. Build momentum, master your movement, and discover just how far a slime can bounce.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/36b3c64f4c68ee2e7669ff1d94fbd40d.poster.avif?t=1788945491\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/36b3c64f4c68ee2e7669ff1d94fbd40d.webm?t=1788945491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/36b3c64f4c68ee2e7669ff1d94fbd40d.mp4?t=1788945491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every Bounce Counts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls with plenty of room to improve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounce across huge gaps, slide under obstacles, launch yourself through the air, and combine your abilities to reach places that seemed impossible at first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're aiming for the finish, every collectible, or a new personal best, there's always another route to find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/cac233ca26e34cf4d9a6801bb1c41227.poster.avif?t=1788945491\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/cac233ca26e34cf4d9a6801bb1c41227.webm?t=1788945491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/cac233ca26e34cf4d9a6801bb1c41227.mp4?t=1788945491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore. Experiment. Improve.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through 5 unique worlds, each with 5 handcrafted levels and its own mechanics and surprises. Collect enough treasures to unlock 10 bonus levels filled with even tougher challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level rewards exploration. Hidden rooms, optional paths, and secret collectibles are waiting for players willing to look beyond the obvious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when you've mastered everything else, there's one final boss waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/71ef22b99d94f538ad40720c73917e3a.poster.avif?t=1788945491\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/71ef22b99d94f538ad40720c73917e3a.webm?t=1788945491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/71ef22b99d94f538ad40720c73917e3a.mp4?t=1788945491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic platformer formula: bounce, slide, launch, and combine movement abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore up to 5 unique worlds with 25 handcrafted levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus 10 bonus levels unlocked by collecting hidden treasures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover all hidden rooms, secret paths, and optional challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4,240 coins and 108 special challenge coins to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight platforming designed for both casual players and speedrunners</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful pixel art with expressive animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 original insanely energetic music tracks by Toni Leys (Denshattack, Rugrats: Adventures in Gameland, Jay and Silent Bob: Chronic Blunt Punch)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BECOME SLIMEY!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/ea0e37b78c50cefadf128aedd42f9493.poster.avif?t=1788945491\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/ea0e37b78c50cefadf128aedd42f9493.webm?t=1788945491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/ea0e37b78c50cefadf128aedd42f9493.mp4?t=1788945491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/132d231c7e1a5fb664c1217532418dba.avif?t=1788945491\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras_big/132d231c7e1a5fb664c1217532418dba.webp?t=1788945491 width=1560 height=502 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become Slimey, a tiny blob with an unstoppable bounce, and make your way through colorful worlds full of platforming challenges, hidden paths, dangerous hazards, and plenty of secrets. Build momentum, master your movement, and discover just how far a slime can bounce.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/36b3c64f4c68ee2e7669ff1d94fbd40d.poster.avif?t=1788945491\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/36b3c64f4c68ee2e7669ff1d94fbd40d.webm?t=1788945491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/36b3c64f4c68ee2e7669ff1d94fbd40d.mp4?t=1788945491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every Bounce Counts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls with plenty of room to improve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounce across huge gaps, slide under obstacles, launch yourself through the air, and combine your abilities to reach places that seemed impossible at first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're aiming for the finish, every collectible, or a new personal best, there's always another route to find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/cac233ca26e34cf4d9a6801bb1c41227.poster.avif?t=1788945491\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/cac233ca26e34cf4d9a6801bb1c41227.webm?t=1788945491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/cac233ca26e34cf4d9a6801bb1c41227.mp4?t=1788945491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore. Experiment. Improve.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through 5 unique worlds, each with 5 handcrafted levels and its own mechanics and surprises. Collect enough treasures to unlock 10 bonus levels filled with even tougher challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level rewards exploration. Hidden rooms, optional paths, and secret collectibles are waiting for players willing to look beyond the obvious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when you've mastered everything else, there's one final boss waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/71ef22b99d94f538ad40720c73917e3a.poster.avif?t=1788945491\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/71ef22b99d94f538ad40720c73917e3a.webm?t=1788945491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/71ef22b99d94f538ad40720c73917e3a.mp4?t=1788945491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic platformer formula: bounce, slide, launch, and combine movement abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore up to 5 unique worlds with 25 handcrafted levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus 10 bonus levels unlocked by collecting hidden treasures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover all hidden rooms, secret paths, and optional challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4,240 coins and 108 special challenge coins to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight platforming designed for both casual players and speedrunners</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful pixel art with expressive animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 original insanely energetic music tracks by Toni Leys (Denshattack, Rugrats: Adventures in Gameland, Jay and Silent Bob: Chronic Blunt Punch)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BECOME SLIMEY!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/ea0e37b78c50cefadf128aedd42f9493.poster.avif?t=1788945491\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/ea0e37b78c50cefadf128aedd42f9493.webm?t=1788945491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/ea0e37b78c50cefadf128aedd42f9493.mp4?t=1788945491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "Go Slimey Go! is a fast-paced 2D platformer built around momentum, exploration, and satisfying movement. Featuring colorful pixel art, handcrafted levels full of secrets, and a highly energetic soundtrack.",
